Support time64 input_event on 32-bit musl

With RUST_LIBC_UNSTABLE_MUSL_V1_2_3 set (abuild default), the libc crate
uses the time64 layout of struct input_event on 32-bit musl, which has
input_event_sec/input_event_usec instead of a struct timeval.

diff -ru a/vendor/evdev-rs/src/device.rs b/vendor/evdev-rs/src/device.rs
